    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abaefuraimu beetegeka okulwana olutalo, baasomoka omwiga Yorudani, baaja e Zafoni, baabuuza Yefutha bati: “Lwaki waja okulwanisa Abammoni, n'otatweta kuja n'iwe? Twidha kukwokera mu ndhu yo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefutha yaabairamu ati: “Nze n'abantu bange twali n'enkaayana nnene n'Abammoni. Imwe nabeeta, aye mwaloba kwidha kubamponia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwenabona nga timwidhie kubamponia, naaghaayo obulamu bwange, naaja okulwanisa Abammoni abo era Musengwa Katonda yampa okubaghangula. Kale, lwaki mwidhie olwaleero okuunwanisa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yefutha yaasoloza abasaadha boonaboona ab'e Gileadi, yaalwanisa Abaefuraimu yaabaghangula kuba Abaefuraimu baali nga bakobye bati: “Imwe Abagileadi abali mu Efuraimu ni mu Manasse, mwalumuka ku Efuraimu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abagileadi baagema ebifo byonabyona omwiga Yorudani ghe gusomokerwa, nga benda okulobera Abaefuraimu okulumuka. Era kiisi Muefuraimu eyagezangaku okulumuka, bwe yaidhanga n'asaba bamuganhe okusomoka, nga bamubuuza bati: “Oli Muefuraimu?” Bwe yairangamu ati: “Busa”, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olwo nga bale bamukoba akobe ati: “Shibbolethi.” Aye ole yaakoba ati: “Sibbolethi”, kuba nga tasobola kukyatula bukalamu. Olwo nga bale bamugema, nga bamwitira mu kifo omwiga Yorudani ghe gusomokerwa. Mu biseera ebyo, Abaefuraimu emitwalo ena n'enkumi ibiri (42,000) n'abaitibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefutha yaakulembera Isiraeli okumala emyaka mukaaga. Agho yaafa, baamuziika mu kibuga kye mu Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefutha bwe yavaagho, Ibuzani ow'e Bethelehemu yaakulembera Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yali ni batabane amakumi asatu, ni baghala be amakumi asatu. Yafumbiza baghala be abo mu bika ebindi, era yaatoola abaghala amakumi asatu mu bika ebindi, yaabaleeta okufumbirwa batabane. Ibuzani oyo yaakulembera Isiraeli okumala emyaka musanvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaafa, baamuziika e Bethelehemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibuzani bwe yavaagho, Eloni Omuzebuluni yaakulembera Isiraeli okumala emyaka ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaafa, baamuziika mu Aiyaloni mu kiketezo ky'e Zebuluni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eloni bwe yavaagho, Abudoni mutabane wa Hilleli Omupirathoni yaakulembera Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yali ni batabane amakumi ana (40), ni baidhukulu be amakumi asatu (30), abaajiiranga ku ndogoyi nsanvu. Abudoni oyo yaakulembera Isiraeli okumala emyaka munaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaafa, baamuziika mu Pirathoni, mu nsi ya Efuraimu, mu kiketezo eky'Abamaleki eky'oku nsozi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
